## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a battery-conscious, offline-friendly data layer with native bridges, cache invalidation, and observability.

## Key Concepts

- React Native JSI/TurboModule bridge
- SQLite-based LRU caching with cachePolicy and maxStalenessMs
- Battery-aware fallbacks and background revalidation
- HTTP semantics: ETag/Last-Modified for invalidation
- Observability: energy cost, cache hit rate, latency

